  "section_module_scope": "Supplied flat projective finite-presentation model over C{t}, invertible model line bundle with ample generic restriction, projective analytic germ/coherent comparison, smooth connected complex fibres and regular SNC chart. Perfect derived cohomology gives finite free section module and flat generic/completed base change; finite coefficient descent gives actual small-fibre basis; analytic-path determinant proves faithful completed Laurent expansion.",
